&lt;p&gt;BeyondTrust is a place where you can bring your purpose to life through the work that you do, creating a safer world through our cybersecurity SaaS portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture of flexibility, trust, and continual learning means you will be recognized for your growth, and for the impact you make on our success. You will be surrounded by people who challenge, support, and inspire you to be the best version of yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Office Administrator is responsible for the day-to-day administrative, facilities, and basic IT support functions of the Dubai office, ensuring a well-organized, compliant, and fully operational workplace. The role acts as the central point of contact for office operations, building management, government compliance visits (including MOHRE), and employee support matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office administration &amp;amp; facilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee daily office operations, ensuring the workplace is organized, well-maintained, and fully operational.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of contact for facilities-related matters, liaising with the building management team and landlords on maintenance, repairs, access, and other facilities issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with office vendors, including cleaning, maintenance, catering, courier, and security services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate office supplies, equipment, and stationery procurement, tracking budgets and expenditure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Ejari registration and renewals for company office premises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the organization of internal meetings, events, and visits, including room bookings, catering, and logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with onboarding logistics for new employees, including workstation setup and office orientation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain office health and safety standards and ensure compliance with local workplace regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage incoming and outgoing correspondence, deliveries, and visitor reception as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with travel arrangements and logistics coordination for staff and visiting colleagues as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support HR and administrative teams with general office-based tasks, document handling, and record-keeping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IT Support Assistant (Office IT Support)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a point of contact for basic office IT needs, such as helping colleagues with simple issues (e.g. connecting to Wi-Fi, printer access) and liaising with the IT teams for anything more involved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the setup of IT equipment and system access (laptops, monitors, peripherals, access, etc.) for new hires as part of onboarding, working closely with the IT team to ensure everything is ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Log and escalate any IT issues to the IT team, and external vendors when necessary, following up to ensure timely resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help keep shared office equipment running smoothly — printers, scanners, and meeting room AV/video-conferencing systems — by reporting faults promptly and coordinating with IT or vendors for maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Government relations &amp;amp; MOHRE compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support MOHRE-related matters by attending ministry visits and appointments in person&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Legal Team on matter relating to MOHRE where necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educational certificate higher than a secondary/high school diploma (e.g. diploma, bachelor&#39;s degree, or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and multitasking skills, with attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good verbal and written communication skills in Arabic and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office (Word, Excel, Outlook) and general comfort with everyday IT systems and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic troubleshooting ability for common IT issues (e.g. connectivity, printers, workstation set-up), or willingness to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, reliable, and professional approach to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to attend government entities (e.g. MOHRE) in person as part of the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable being entrusted with sensitive company items and information, including custody of the company stamp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in an administrative, office support, or customer-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior exposure to basic IT support or helpdesk tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with office management software, IT ticketing systems, or facilities management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in developing a career within a corporate or technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Better Together&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity. Inclusion. They’re more than just words for us. They are the guiding values of how we build our teams, cultivate leaders, and create a culture where people feel connected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We take care of our employees so they can take care of our customers. Customers who&amp;nbsp;come from all walks of life just like us. We hire incredible people from diverse backgrounds because when we are different together, we are stronger together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;About Us&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BeyondTrust is the global identity security leader protecting Paths to Privilege™. Our identity-centric approach goes beyond securing privileges and access, empowering organizations with the most effective solution to manage the entire identity attack surface and neutralize threats, whether from external attacks or insiders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BeyondTrust is leading the charge in transforming identity security to prevent breaches and limit the blast radius of attacks, while creating a superior customer experience and operational efficiencies. We are trusted by 20,000 customers, including 75 of the Fortune 100, and our global ecosystem of partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.beyondtrust.com/&quot;&gt;www.beyondtrust.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
